mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: jake-whale-offer-builder\ndescription: \"Offer Builder. Writes the offer they can say yes to. One page: the problem in their own numbers, what they get, the price, the date it ships, and the way out, with the plain statement that it isn't finished yet. A lint refuses an offer that leaves any of that out or that leans on fake urgency, made-up proof and promises nobody can keep. Every offer waits for your yes. Use when the user says \\\"write the offer\\\", \\\"make them an offer\\\", \\\"offer page\\\", \\\"proposal\\\", \\\"one-pager\\\", \\\"what do I send them\\\", \\\"they asked for details\\\", or \\\"founding customer offer\\\".\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/whale-skill\n  upstream_skill: offer-builder\n  upstream_commit: 67390fc00e9c33f2d9f9ed5c3d52e330d520dc72\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
